   "announcedAt": "2024-10-05T00:29:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-- New: A magic stone has been added, which can very rarely appear in the dungeon. If it is destroyed, all the blocks along the x and y axes from this block will collapse. This will make your task much easier!",
